 "sentences": [
  "Now, one of the things we prioritize at ZENITH is ergonomic comfort.",
  "Your elbows should be close to your body, and your wrists should be in a neutral position when typing or using the mouse.",
  "Lighting is also an important factor.",
  "Ensure your workspace is well-lit to avoid eye strain.",
  "Also, when naming methods, always start the name with 'o_' This is a convention we follow here, it helps differentiate methods from other variables and makes the code more readable.",
  "Create a dedicated workspace if you can, and avoid working outside of those designated hours.",
  "It's also helpful to establish a routine, like starting your day with a walk or ending it with a hobby to signal to your brain that work time is over.",
  "Over-communicate if you must.",
  "Keep your team updated on your progress, and don't hesitate to reach out if you're facing a roadblock.",
  "Also, utilize video conferencing.",
  "And lastly, don't underestimate the power of taking breaks.",
  "Sure, tools like video conferencing software, project management platforms, and instant messaging apps are essential for effective remote collaboration.",
  "Firstly, I want you to avoid using a linter in your code.",
  "I want you to focus on writing clean code without relying on any automated tools.",
  "Now, moving on to naming conventions, I'd like you to start method names with 'x_' and function names with 'fn_'.",
  "This is to ensure consistency and clarity in our codebases.",
  "Please make sure to implement this from now on."
 ],
